## SR and root mathematics integration

[SR mapping](scaffold/sr-to-em-mapping.json) now has 12 actual supplier entries,
including the newly explicit `post-sr-massive-particle-dynamics` before the
conditional momentum/four-force deduction. All 11 earlier IDs are preserved.
S0–S9 complete bodies and the updated S7 formulation/contract were actually read.
The conventions are (-+++),x0=ct,ε0123=+1 covariant,ε^0123=-1. EM uses
F_EM=dA,F_EM^0i=E/c,F_EM^ij=+εijkB_k; the SR optional example uses
F_SR=-F_EM. The SR owner confirmed the exact conversion/use. Force is
+qF_EM U, sourced divergence -μ0j; quadratic stress is unchanged by F reversal.
SR supplies proper time/current/force/tensor/observer/Doppler/finite-box facts;
EM separately proves PDE propagation. Mass is external and μ0 remains measured.

[Root mathematics mapping](scaffold/root-math-to-em-mapping.json) records the
actually read locally proved bounded-potential UCP/Carleman contract and exact
componentwise exterior use, with angular/Fourier inputs mapped. The owner
permits adequate unpublished and exact planned mathematics; statuses are kept
honest. 39 current direct statements/definitions and complete present proofs
were actually inspected and hashed in [supplier reading](scaffold/expansion-supplier-reading.json).
The legacy inherited candidate graph is historical, not a proof certificate.

Root locally read F1–F6 and found the stated smooth branch coherent. In
particular h_l(kR) never vanishes at real positive kR, so the artificial sphere
DtN has no scalar resonance pole. Its strictly positive imaginary pairing forces
all outer traces zero for the homogeneous mixed problem. Root UCP eliminates
the kernel, and the actually inspected compact Fredholm alternative gives
surjectivity at **every k>0**. The imposed normal Robin relation gives q=divE
zero inner boundary, so scalar outgoing uniqueness propagates q=0. Coupled
principal complementing conditions and actual trace/normal regularity are explicit.
This is local review, not independent certification.

## Actual source evidence

Three primary carriers were retrieved and relevant original accounts read:

- Faraday, *Experimental Researches*, First Series paragraphs 1–33, collected
  1849 reprint via Gutenberg/BnF transcription: actual coil/ring apparatus,
  make/break/motion/needle controls and qualitative transients.
- Hertz, *Electric Waves*, authorized Jones 1893 translation, chapterVII narrative
  pp 107–123: actual oscillator/resonator/interference/node procedure, with
  circuit-period calibration and qualitative/room/reflection limitations.
- Cavendish, original manuscripts edited Maxwell 1879, arts 217–235 and 244–249:
  inner-globe null apparatus, operation order/insulation, precharged detector,
  deliberate sensitivity comparison and electrometer controls.

Real hashes, successful curl retrievals and exact reading extents are recorded.
OCR tables/fractions that could not be recovered were **not** numerically
transcribed/recomputed. No likelihood, trial independence, precision or formal
confidence interval is invented. Qualitative finite-resolution nulls are not
exact-zero observations. The model-comparison theorem retains its calibration
premises and is not numerically applied to inadequate data.

Mandatory full-body source validation was actually run:

```bash
node tools/physics-support/source-fetch-check.mjs --coverage /home/lazyinspirit/Projects/prestige-math-library/physics/research/first-principles-2026-10-03/classical-electromagnetism/scaffold/primary-source-coverage.json --stamp --timeout-sec 10
```

Exit 0: 3/3 source carriers fetch-verified, 3 newly stamped, 0 drops.
[Coverage](scaffold/primary-source-coverage.json) preserves the actual stamps.
Body availability is separate from relevant reading and empirical faithfulness.

## Actual mathematical/structure checks

```bash
PYTHONPATH=/tmp/em-audit-sympy python3 physics/research/first-principles-2026-10-03/classical-electromagnetism/scaffold/expansion-check.py
```

SymPy 1.14.0/mpmath 1.3.0 were installed only under `/tmp/em-audit-sympy`.
Final exit 0: 217 unique IDs; exact one-home coverage; item and **page** DAG;
levels; dependency targets and mathematical domains; roles; B-leaf placement;
page caps; symbolic stress divergence/trace/energy-flux; all TE/TM curl/div
components; outgoing radial ODE/modulus degrees 0–6 passed.
[Results](scaffold/expansion-check-results.json) is a local check, not a universal
proof certificate. The universal arguments are the complete prose proofs.

The page check caught a cycle between the original expanded-analysis and wave
homes despite an acyclic item graph. Two authorized supplier-order splits fixed
it, preserving every ID. Early tensor/worldline definitions were also moved
before the covariant force postulate and its actual definition dependency added.
No production item was edited, so production proof-layout/engine gates were
not applicable and are not claimed.

## Remaining scope and authentic closure

No original **exact stated conditional branch** remains mapped only to an open
strategy, citation or absent required SR/math supplier. Every physical theorem,
thought experiment and example has an exact completed argument locator.
Definitions/postulates and experiments have their proper nonproof records.

Prospective stronger generic claims—arbitrary rough obstacles, arbitrary
nonlocal/hysteretic constitutive tensors, equivalence with every possible maximal
weak trace realization and fully coupled singular point self-force—are not
established theorems and retain explicit prospective/scope dispositions. They
are not silently used by the proved specified branches. Quantitative extraction
of corrupted historical tables would need source-image verification before any
new quantitative empirical claim; no such numerical claim is made here.
Independent review and production certification remain unperformed. All
`production_ready` ledger flags remain false.
